# Hardware bench: 10-second Macro view with fixture notes, CC lane and shared LFOs.
# Uses the versioned macro-multi-modulation fixture, without editing user state.
# Default compiler duration is the final timestamp + 1000 ms = 10000 ms.
# macro.performance is the benchmark's state-only projection at the Macro root.
0 scenario bench-macro-v1
0 marker playback_idle
20 assert_view MACRO
40 assert_mode macro.performance
100 transport start
3000 assert_view MACRO
3020 assert_mode macro.performance
6000 assert_view MACRO
6020 assert_mode macro.performance
8800 assert_view MACRO
8820 assert_mode macro.performance
9000 transport stop
